# Local Google Business Profile connection

- Read credentials only from `.mds/gbp-oauth.json` (gitignored).
- Keyword sheet URL lives only in `.mds/gbp-sheet.json` (gitignored). Do not print it.
- Never print Client secrets, refresh tokens, Authorization headers, or those files.
- Use `python3 scripts/gbp_connect.py status` to verify. Account count and location title are enough.
